GodSmithFeralClaws.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Wild Tempo: chaining melee hits within 2.5s stacks +1% melee speed each, up to 8 stacks
	At 6+ stacks strikes shed feral claw sparks; taking a hit breaks the tempo
	'''
GodSmithTitanGlove.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Titan Quake: every 5th melee strike slams a shockwave around the target
	Deals 35% / 45% / 55% of that strike (Titan / Power / Mechanical) in an area with heavy knockback
	'''
GodSmithFireGauntlet.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Molten Quake: every 5th melee strike erupts a burning shockwave dealing 60% of that strike
	The blast ignites foes with hellfire
	'''
GodSmithBerserkerGlove.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Berserk Quake: every 5th melee strike detonates a shockwave dealing 70% of that strike
	Each quake drives you berserk: +10% melee speed for 3s
	'''
GodSmithWarriorEmblem.EffectDesc:
	'''
	War Momentum: melee hits build fervor, +1.5% melee damage per stack, up to 6 stacks (4s)
	At full stacks strikes flare gold; taking a hit sheds 3 stacks
	'''
GodSmithRangerEmblem.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Long Hunt: ranged hits from over 25 tiles away grant Focus for 4s: +8% ranged damage
	Focused hits gleam with silver tracer sparks
	'''
GodSmithSorcererEmblem.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Arcane Resurge: magic hits restore 6 mana, or 12 when below 30% mana
	Triggers once every 0.75s
	'''
GodSmithSummonerEmblem.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Legion Call: minion and whip hits rally the legion, +1.5% summon damage per stack, up to 4 stacks (6s)
	Reaching full rally pulses a golden command ring
	'''
GodSmithAvengerEmblem.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Avenger's Brand: taking a hit brands you with vengeance for 5s: +8% damage of all types
	The brand flares blood-gold when struck
	'''
GodSmithDestroyerEmblem.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Annihilation Protocol: striking a foe below 20% life fires a crimson probe pulse at it
	The pulse deals 50% of that strike, once every 0.67s
	'''
GodSmithEyeoftheGolem.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Golem's Gaze: landing a critical hit locks the gaze for 4s: +6% critical strike chance
	Triggers once every 1.5s; gazing crits burn with sun sparks
	'''
GodSmithMagicQuiver.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Lumen Draw: every 7th ranged hit conjures a spectral bolt that homes in on the target
	The bolt deals 45% of that hit as it pierces
	'''
GodSmithMoltenQuiver.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Molten Core: ranged hits ignite the target with hellfire, once every 0.75s
	Each ignition stokes your core for 4s: +6 ranged armor penetration
	'''
GodSmithStalkersQuiver.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Stalker's Veil: after 4s without taking damage you slip into the veil: +8% ranged damage
	Veiled hits trail dusk sparks; taking a hit breaks the veil
	'''
GodSmithNaturesGift.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Nature's Boon: magic hits bloom with life, healing 5 HP and restoring 5 mana
	Triggers once every 1.5s
	'''
GodSmithManaFlower.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Nectar Surge: dropping below 20% mana instantly restores 50 mana in a burst of petals
	Triggers once every 10s
	'''
GodSmithArcaneFlower.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Arcane Siphon: magic hits siphon power, +1% magic damage per stack, up to 6 stacks (5s)
	At full siphon your spells also cost 5% less mana
	'''
GodSmithMagnetFlower.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Magnetic Arc: magic hits fling an arc of charge to another foe within 19 tiles
	The arc deals 35% of that hit, once every 0.75s
	'''
GodSmithManaCloak.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Woven Stars: magic hits weave mana stardust around you, up to 3 charges
	When struck, all stored stardust flies out as homing star bolts dealing 60 damage each
	'''
GodSmithRifleScope.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Steady Aim: standing still for 1.25s steadies the scope; your next ranged hit looses a piercing tracer
	The tracer deals 45% / 60% / 75% of that hit (Rifle / Sniper / Recon) and pierces 2 / 3 / 4 foes
	Moving fast drains your aim
	'''
GodSmithPygmyNecklace.EffectDesc:
	'''
	War Dance: minion hits keep the dance alive, +1.2% summon damage per stack, up to 5 stacks (6s)
	At full tempo minion strikes scatter tribal feather sparks
	'''
GodSmithNecromanticScroll.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Soul Harvest: when a minion kill lands, a bound soulflame rises from the corpse
	It homes in on the nearest foe dealing 40% of the killing blow, once every 1.5s
	'''
GodSmithPapyrusScarab.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Gilded Scarab: minion hits gild the target with Midas, once every 1s
	While any foe is gilded, your minions deal +5% damage
	'''
GodSmithHerculesBeetle.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Hercules Ram: minion hits build wrestling might; at 8 charges the next minion hit
	looses a colossal beetle horn that rams through the line, dealing 90% of that hit with massive knockback
	'''
GodSmithShackle.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Soulbound Irons: taking a hit anchors you for 4s: immune to knockback and +4 defense
	Triggers once every 5s
	'''
GodSmithCobaltShield.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Bulwark Echo: taking a hit rings the shield, granting +6 / +8 / +10 defense (Cobalt / Obsidian / Ankh) for 3s
	Obsidian's echo ignites nearby foes; Ankh's echo also cleanses up to 2 debuffs
	Triggers once every 4s
	'''
GodSmithPaladinsShield.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Paladin's Retribution: taking a hit hurls a judging hammer at the nearest foe
	The hammer deals 150% of the damage you took and pierces 3, once every 5s
	Damage absorbed for teammates counts too
	'''
GodSmithHeroShield.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Hero's Pact: taking a hit seals a pact for 5s: +8 defense, and your melee hits drain 1 HP
	Triggers once every 4s
	'''
GodSmithFrozenShield.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Cryo Ward: a killing blow instead freezes into the crystal: you survive at 25% max life,
	nearby foes are blasted with frostburn, and you gain brief immunity
	Once every 90s
	'''
GodSmithStarCloak.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Starfall Echo: taking a hit calls down 2 godsmith stars beyond the vanilla ones
	Each deals 40 damage and rakes a golden trail, once every 2s
	'''
GodSmithBeeCloak.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Guardian Swarm: taking a hit startles 3 bees from the cloak and coats you in honey for 5s
	Triggers once every 3s
	'''
GodSmithCrossNecklace.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Martyr's Mending: taking a hit opens a 3s mending window: +3 HP/s regeneration
	and knockback immunity while it lasts
	'''
GodSmithStarVeil.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Star Curtain: taking a hit draws a curtain of starlight for 2.5s: further damage taken is reduced by 30%
	Triggers once every 5s
	'''
GodSmithMoonCharm.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Lunar Hunt: at night your melee bites drain 2 HP from the prey, once every 0.5s
	Each bite gleams with moon-silver sparks
	'''
GodSmithMoonStone.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Lunar Aegis: at night, taking a hit veils you in moonlight for 4s: +8 defense
	Triggers once every 4s
	'''
GodSmithNeptunesShell.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Tidal Surge: plunging into water raises a tide guard for 5s: +6 defense, once every 5s
	While wet your strikes splash with sea foam
	'''
GodSmithCelestialStone.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Day and Night Phases: by day your strikes ignite foes with hellfire; by night they sear with frostburn
	Triggers once every 2s, flaring sun-gold or moon-frost
	'''
GodSmithCelestialShell.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Total Celestial: by day strikes ignite, by night they frostburn, once every 1.5s
	Plunging into water raises a tide guard for 5s: +8 defense, once every 5s
	'''
GodSmithCharmofMyths.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Mythic Afterglow: drinking a healing potion leaves an afterglow for 8s: +2 HP/s regeneration
	The glow swirls emerald while it mends
	'''
GodSmithWormScarf.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Symbiotic Carapace: each hit taken grows a carapace plate: -4% damage taken per plate, up to 3 plates (8s)
	The scarf coils tighter the harder you are pressed
	'''
GodSmithBrainOfConfusion.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Neural Shockwave: taking a hit bursts a psychic wave: nearby foes are confused for 3s
	and your own mind overclocks: +8% damage for 3s. Triggers once every 4s
	'''
GodSmithShieldofCthulhu.EffectDesc:
	'''
	Pupil Rupture: bashing a foe with your dash ruptures a crimson shockwave around it
	dealing 25 damage with heavy knockback, once every 1.5s
	Dashing trails a crimson gaze
	'''
